    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703920/extras/501a01761d9256381aaa2a3079208d24.avif?t=1752933877\" width=525 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sarah is a 21 year old university student who's kidnaped on her way home. and wakes up inside a secret facility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703920/extras/076ae6ae7c577e1ab91c9e4faffb3f73.poster.avif?t=1752933877\" width=636 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703920/extras/076ae6ae7c577e1ab91c9e4faffb3f73.webm?t=1752933877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703920/extras/076ae6ae7c577e1ab91c9e4faffb3f73.mp4?t=1752933877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>is a research facility that studies deadly bacteria and viruses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > searching for a vaccine to repair dead cells and cell regeneration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the study seeks to find the equation of brain-dead people and patients in a state of severe coma and severe infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703920/extras/fc7b95c3bda06cdf5080f10b719d0f6d.poster.avif?t=1752933877\" width=636 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703920/extras/fc7b95c3bda06cdf5080f10b719d0f6d.webm?t=1752933877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703920/extras/fc7b95c3bda06cdf5080f10b719d0f6d.mp4?t=1752933877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>When an outbreak of an infection spreads in a laboratory,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >killing the survivors and turning them into lifeless creatures driven only by the impulse of contagion,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mutated by the infection and creating the living dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2703920/extras/bff028e5bb897653b65205bb5071ead8.avif?t=1752933877\" width=525 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains scenes of nudity, explicit violence and blood and death.</p>",
